  "nsfw": true,
  "description": "Model format: int8 ConvRot. Steps: 8 by default.\n\nMiniMax H3 on eatyet's Heptagram v2 Entropy preview: a merged checkpoint with the TaoMate and HyperFlow speed LoRAs built in, one 19.5 GB file with no LoRA to load. Text, image and reference cards at eight steps. It is a preview, and the author says v2's final form depends on community feedback. High contrast, dense detail, big expressions and very loud sound. It does not hold a locked-off camera. A separate download from Heptagram Turbo. MiniMax H3 Community License; read its territorial and commercial-use terms before commercial use.",
