          "notes": "One 19.5 GB checkpoint with TaoMate and HyperFlow merged in, plus the shared H3 text encoder and VAEs. Preview release; the Civitai version is 'Heptagram_v2_Entropy prev'. res_multistep / simple, 8 steps, sigma shift 12 video / 3 audio set in the workflow, inside the author's ranges (4-8 steps, shift 6-16 video, 3 audio). IN-APP 2026-11-01 (RTX 4070 Ti 12 GB, 31 GB RAM, engine 0.43.0, the agent route, 5 s): 75-79 s at 864x480, 217 s at 1344x768, two prompts, one seed each; graphs read back. ENGINE 2026-11-01, 15 s at 864x480: 290 s. Movement on a locked-off prompt (three seeds, drift figure): 31-43 against stock 10-17. Audio, mean level: -14.0 dB on busy prompts against stock -30; the engine's audio decode caps level at -14 dB, so the model is at or above that cap. Quiet-room prompt -20 to -24 dB against stock -52 to -59 and Heptagram Turbo -42. Transcription found no words in those clips. By band, below 150 Hz holds about -22 to -31 dB through most of the clip on all three seeds (stock -61 to -67), with only short breath-like bursts above 1 kHz. Heard on one clip, seed 4242: low rumble, then a breath at about 3 s, which the prompt allows. The same seed puts a breath at about the same moment on stock, Heptagram Turbo and PRISM-PIKA, far quieter."
